# Locale banks: `loadbank` registers the sidecar, `locale` swaps the
# active override map with no code reload, untranslated keys fall back,
# and `locale ""` returns to the source language. Digests pin the loaded
# bank list + active locale through a save/load round trip.
loadbank locale.fr.loombank
set Time.hour 6
start greet
run             # source language
locale fr
start greet
run             # French: literals swap, {Time.hour} still evaluates
choose 0
run
locale
start greet
run             # back to the source (bare `locale` = source language)
save
load
run
